.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-PCM-METERS 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-pcm\-meters \- read capture and playback PCM peaks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-pcm-meters\fR [SECONDS | \fB\-\-read\fR] [ALSA-CARD]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read PCM peak controls exposed by the standalone module.
SECONDS is 1..60, default 1. Normal mode acquires a meter lease and may run
the driver's zero-output idle PCM engine when ordinary audio streams are absent.
Normal PCM users take precedence. Handled SIGINT/SIGTERM releases the lease.
.PP
\fB\-\-read\fR reads one passive snapshot without enabling the engine.
Output is JSON. Missing/stale peaks are not fabricated.
.PP
The default ALSA control device is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
